text docs/mcp-enclave.md :: | §15.6 | the content-mode sentence that attachment contents are unavailable stays
media docs/mcp-enclave.md :: > media and attachments the archive cannot verify are never opened, and
media docs/mcp-enclave.md :: anexos que o arquivo não > consegue verificar nunca são abertos
media docs/mcp-enclave.md :: > attachments it no longer holds are never opened."

